{"3833910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeons With Friends", "steam_appid": 3833910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833910/extras/699c7e27a575a91bda2d8103c660dc6b.avif?t=1780371987\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shout spells. Break robots. Survive the dungeon... with friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833910/extras/ec1ff047ba045e0d134ced63b6f03589.avif?t=1780371987\" alt=\"Really Cool Dungeons With Friends Banner Image\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833910/extras_big/ec1ff047ba045e0d134ced63b6f03589.avif?t=1780371987 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons With Friends</strong> is a chaotic <strong>co-op roguelike</strong> where you and your friends play as puppet wizards shouting spells into your microphones to fight through a tower full of <strong>evil robots.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore elemental floors filled with interactive environments, unpredictable enemies, and powerful bosses. <strong>Learn new spells</strong>, attach <strong>wild modifiers</strong>, and <strong>chain movement abilities</strong> to survive increasingly dangerous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends, master dozens of spells across multiple elements, and discover how ridiculous- and magical a dungeon can be when you face it together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast spells with your voice</strong> - longer incantations unleash stronger magic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop-in co-op for 1-4 players</strong> (solo friendly!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental floors</strong> with unique enemies, hazards, and bosses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, expressive movement</strong> built for stylish combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetics &amp; unlockables</strong> to show off your wizard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sentient robot enemies</strong> that cooperate and adapt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runs that feel handcrafted and surprising!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833910/extras/699c7e27a575a91bda2d8103c660dc6b.avif?t=1780371987\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shout spells. Break robots. Survive the dungeon... with friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833910/extras/ec1ff047ba045e0d134ced63b6f03589.avif?t=1780371987\" alt=\"Really Cool Dungeons With Friends Banner Image\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833910/extras_big/ec1ff047ba045e0d134ced63b6f03589.avif?t=1780371987 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons With Friends</strong> is a chaotic <strong>co-op roguelike</strong> where you and your friends play as puppet wizards shouting spells into your microphones to fight through a tower full of <strong>evil robots.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore elemental floors filled with interactive environments, unpredictable enemies, and powerful bosses. <strong>Learn new spells</strong>, attach <strong>wild modifiers</strong>, and <strong>chain movement abilities</strong> to survive increasingly dangerous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends, master dozens of spells across multiple elements, and discover how ridiculous- and magical a dungeon can be when you face it together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast spells with your voice</strong> - longer incantations unleash stronger magic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop-in co-op for 1-4 players</strong> (solo friendly!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental floors</strong> with unique enemies, hazards, and bosses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, expressive movement</strong> built for stylish combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetics &amp; unlockables</strong> to show off your wizard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sentient robot enemies</strong> that cooperate and adapt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runs that feel handcrafted and surprising!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dungeons With Friends is a co-op roguelike where you and your friends shout spells into your microphones to fight through a tower full of evil robots.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833910/b429a65b6b1f9f09eed54e5e1df691f2ecef1cae/header.jpg?t=1780371987", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833910/3cfdf8794c7650e644143acb4e4dc2f390283010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780371987", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833910/3cfdf8794c7650e644143acb4e4dc2f390283010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=178037198